* Sat Oct 10 2026 Joshua Jun <joshuajun@proton.me> 0.2-1
- Slimmer timeline menu: swipe left for notifications, tap the header to switch feeds
- Settings moved to the pull-down menu on your own profile
- New post action on the cover
- Timeline catches up when returning to the app
- Media and Likes tabs on profiles, with empty-state text
- Swipe between images in the full-screen viewer
- Choose who can reply to new posts
- Posts are tagged with your system language
- Tapping a notification banner opens the post or profile
- Sign-in can be cancelled and times out instead of spinning forever

